# a4_mini.manifest — focused typed-channel (A4-class) regression closure.
#
# The mir_mini closure plus tg_compiler/a4_probe.tg, whose entry runs the
# kernel front end over tests/differential/corpus/01_defs_arith.tg and
# reports the typed-channel internal errors. Run by the tg_a4 selfcheck
# through the seed VM.
